Test globals for role registration. Steps:
1. Register yourself as "orchestrator": (globals/update :roles (fn [m] (assoc m (current-handle) "orchestrator")))
2. Spawn a worker: (spawn llm-self "Register yourself as worker-a in globals: (globals/update :roles (fn [m] (assoc m (current-handle) \"worker-a\"))). Then look up the orchestrator handle from (globals/get :roles) — find the entry with value \"orchestrator\" — and send it 42: (send (create-msg 'result 42) orchestrator-handle).")
3. '(recv) to get the result. Return it.
